{"5057090":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cartoon Crime","steam_appid":5057090,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon Crime<\/strong> is an open-world crime action game where you can follow the story, build up your character, or forget the objective entirely and make your own trouble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cities, districts, islands, and hidden locations on foot or by vehicle. Take on missions, earn money, buy weapons, improve your skills, recruit bodyguards, and discover activities throughout the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>third-person and classic top-down views<\/strong> at any time. Stay close to the action during shootouts and driving, or pull the camera back for an old-school crime-game perspective.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is built to be explored rather than simply driven through. Enter gun stores, gyms, restaurants, cinemas, shops, and other interiors. Play bowling or billiards, use arcade machines, work out, grab something to eat, or look for new ways to spend the money you make.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat ranges from street fights and melee weapons to firearms and large-scale shootouts. Train your character, improve different skills, and enter <strong>kickboxing challenges<\/strong> against increasingly difficult opponents for cash rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause enough trouble and the police will respond. Your <strong>wanted level<\/strong> rises as the situation escalates, turning small incidents into full police chases and larger confrontations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also recruit <strong>bodyguards<\/strong> who travel with you and fight alongside you when things get dangerous.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or jump into <strong>online co-op<\/strong> and explore the sandbox together.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world crime action with story missions and free-roam gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple cities, districts, islands, and locations to explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant switching between <strong>third-person and top-down perspectives<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and online co-op<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars, bicycles, boats, aircraft, and other vehicles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enterable gun stores, gyms, restaurants, cinemas, shops, and other interiors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police chases with escalating wanted levels<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms, melee weapons, fist fighting, and kicks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickboxing challenges<\/strong> with tougher opponents and cash rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character skills that improve through gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruitable bodyguards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival gangs and hostile NPC encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilians who react to fights, crime, and chaos around them<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowling, billiards, arcade machines, cinema visits, gyms, and other side activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to follow the story or simply explore and create chaos<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take missions, train your character, build a crew, explore the world, challenge fighters, escape the police, or just see what happens when you stop following the objective marker.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon Crime is a crime sandbox built around giving you things to do and letting you decide what happens next.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon Crime<\/strong> is an open-world crime action game where you can follow the story, build up your character, or forget the objective entirely and make your own trouble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cities, districts, islands, and hidden locations on foot or by vehicle. Take on missions, earn money, buy weapons, improve your skills, recruit bodyguards, and discover activities throughout the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch instantly between <strong>third-person and classic top-down views<\/strong> at any time. Stay close to the action during shootouts and driving, or pull the camera back for an old-school crime-game perspective.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is built to be explored rather than simply driven through. Enter gun stores, gyms, restaurants, cinemas, shops, and other interiors. Play bowling or billiards, use arcade machines, work out, grab something to eat, or look for new ways to spend the money you make.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat ranges from street fights and melee weapons to firearms and large-scale shootouts. Train your character, improve different skills, and enter <strong>kickboxing challenges<\/strong> against increasingly difficult opponents for cash rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause enough trouble and the police will respond. Your <strong>wanted level<\/strong> rises as the situation escalates, turning small incidents into full police chases and larger confrontations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also recruit <strong>bodyguards<\/strong> who travel with you and fight alongside you when things get dangerous.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or jump into <strong>online co-op<\/strong> and explore the sandbox together.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world crime action with story missions and free-roam gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple cities, districts, islands, and locations to explore<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant switching between <strong>third-person and top-down perspectives<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and online co-op<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars, bicycles, boats, aircraft, and other vehicles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enterable gun stores, gyms, restaurants, cinemas, shops, and other interiors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police chases with escalating wanted levels<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firearms, melee weapons, fist fighting, and kicks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickboxing challenges<\/strong> with tougher opponents and cash rewards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character skills that improve through gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruitable bodyguards<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rival gangs and hostile NPC encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilians who react to fights, crime, and chaos around them<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowling, billiards, arcade machines, cinema visits, gyms, and other side activities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to follow the story or simply explore and create chaos<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take missions, train your character, build a crew, explore the world, challenge fighters, escape the police, or just see what happens when you stop following the objective marker.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoon Crime is a crime sandbox built around giving you things to do and letting you decide what happens next.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Cartoon Crime is an open-world crime sandbox where missions are optional and chaos is always one bad decision away. Switch instantly between third-person and top-down gameplay, drive, fight, recruit bodyguards, outrun the police, and explore the world alone or in online co-op.","supported_languages":"English, Turkish, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Italian, Arabic, Korean, Swedish, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Polish, Hungarian, Romanian, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Czech","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5057090\/4d32e543c7d1b594c12b619b9b892287c55dc027\/header.jpg?t=1793696669","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5057090\/6af2d71a81096fb3880e4460c050947856c7045f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793696669","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5057090\/6af2d71a81096fb3880e4460c050947856c7045f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793696669","website":"https:\/\/www.bubagamestudio.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 1660 Super<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>",